This plugin began as a clone of the built-in `omarchy.clock` shell plugin
(created with `omarchy plugin clone omarchy.clock`) and remains a derivative
work of it.

`BarWidget.qml`, `Model.js` and the clock, year-progress, life-bar and
month-grid portions of `Panel.qml` originate from Omarchy:

    Omarchy — https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy
    MIT License
    Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson

The MIT license text of the original is identical to the one in LICENSE.

Added by this project: the appointment layer — `Events.js`, the event
markers in the month grid, the day-selection and agenda section in
`Panel.qml`, and everything under `exporters/`.
